 "meta_description": "Compare INR pay-as-you-go pricing for Sarvam Text to Speech, Speech to Text, LLM, Translate, Document AI and Dubbing APIs, plus enterprise terms.",
 "text": "Products\nDevelopers\nResources\nCompany\nLog In\nContact Us\nBuy credits once,\nuse them anywhere\n\nStart with free credits, then pay only for what you use. Every supported API draws from the same balance.\n\nPay as you go\n\n\u20b90\n/month\n\nAdd credits\nNo monthly commitment\nBulbul V3 text to speech at \u20b93.00 per 1,000 characters\nSpeech to text at \u20b90.49 per minute\nUniversal credits across supported APIs\n\nPro\n\n\u20b99,999\n/month\n\nAdd credits\nBulbul V3 text to speech at \u20b92.85 per 1,000 characters\nSpeech to text at \u20b90.45 per minute\nUniversal credits across supported APIs\n\nGrowth\n\n\u20b949,999\n/month\n\nAdd credits\nBulbul V3 text to speech at \u20b92.70 per 1,000 characters\nSpeech to text at \u20b90.41 per minute\nUniversal credits across supported APIs\n\nBusiness\n\n\u20b91,99,999\n/month\n\nAdd credits\nBulbul V3 text to speech at \u20b92.60 per 1,000 characters\nSpeech to text at \u20b90.38 per minute\nUniversal credits across supported APIs\n\nEnterprise\n\nCustom pricing\n\nTailored limits, throughput, pricing, and support for high-volume or production-critical workloads.\n\nRequest enterprise plan\nHigher rate limits on every API\nCustom concurrency & throughput\nVolume discounts on credits\nDedicated support & SLAs\n\nBuilding voice agents?\n\nEnd-to-end pricing with the models included, as low as \u20b93 a minute.\n\nExplore Voice Agents pricing\nDetailed API pricing\n\nOpen a category to compare every pay-per-use rate.\n\nText to speech\nSERVICE\nPAY AS YOU GO\nPRO\nGROWTH\nBUSINESS\nBulbul V4 Flash, real-time\nLimited time, 50% off until 12 Nov\nper 1,000 characters\n\u20b92.00\u20b91.00\n\u20b91.85\u20b90.925\n\u20b91.70\u20b90.85\n\u20b91.70\u20b90.80\nBulbul V4 Flash, streaming\nLimited time, 50% off until 12 Nov\nper 1,000 characters\n\u20b92.00\u20b91.00\n\u20b91.85\u20b90.925\n\u20b91.70\u20b90.85\n\u20b91.70\u20b90.80\nBulbul V4 Flash, WebSocket\nLimited time, 50% off until 12 Nov\nper 1,000 characters\n\u20b92.00\u20b91.00\n\u20b91.85\u20b90.925\n\u20b91.70\u20b90.85\n\u20b91.70\u20b90.80\nBulbul V3, real-time\nper 1,000 characters\n\u20b93.00\n\u20b92.85\n\u20b92.70\n\u20b92.60\nBulbul V3, streaming\nper 1,000 characters\n\u20b93.00\n\u20b92.85\n\u20b92.70\n\u20b92.60\nBulbul V3, WebSocket\nper 1,000 characters\n\u20b93.00\n\u20b92.85\n\u20b92.70\n\u20b92.60\nVoice cloning, real-time\nper 1,000 characters\n\u20b92.00\n\u20b92.00\n\u20b92.00\n\u20b92.00\nSpeech to text\nSERVICE\nPAY AS YOU GO\nPRO\nGROWTH\nBUSINESS\nReal-time\nper minute\n\u20b90.49\n\u20b90.45\n\u20b90.41\n\u20b90.38\nBatch\nper minute\n\u20b90.49\n\u20b90.45\n\u20b90.41\n\u20b90.38\nBatch with diarization\nper minute\n\u20b90.59\n\u20b90.54\n\u20b90.50\n\u20b90.47\nLanguage identification\nper 1,000 characters\n\u20b90.35\n\u20b90.35\n\u20b90.31\n\u20b90.29\nLLM\nInput / cached input / output\nAPI SERVICE\nPRICE\nBILLING UNIT\nSarvam 105B\n\u20b915.00 / \u20b95.00 / \u20b960.00\nper 1M tokens\nGemma 4\n\u20b935.00 / \u20b910.00 / \u20b990.00\nper 1M tokens\nGLM 5.3\n\u20b9126.00 / \u20b920.00 / \u20b9390.00\nper 1M tokens\nGLM 5.3 Flash\n\u20b913.50 / \u20b92.50 / \u20b945.00\nper 1M tokens\nDeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017\n\u20b925.00 / \u20b90.50 / \u20b9105.00\nper 1M tokens\nTranslate & transliterate\nTranslation and transliteration\nSERVICE\nPAY AS YOU GO\nPRO\nGROWTH\nBUSINESS\nTranslate\nTranslation and transliteration\nper 1,000 characters\n\u20b92.00\n\u20b91.70\n\u20b91.50\n\u20b91.35\nTranslate, formal\nTranslation and transliteration\nper 1,000 characters\n\u20b92.00\n\u20b91.70\n\u20b91.50\n\u20b91.35\nTranslate, colloquial\nTranslation and transliteration\nper 1,000 characters\n\u20b92.00\n\u20b91.70\n\u20b91.50\n\u20b91.35\nTransliterate\nTranslation and transliteration\nper 1,000 characters\n\u20b92.00\n\u20b92.00\n\u20b91.80\n\u20b91.70\nDoc translation\nTranslation and transliteration\nper 1,000 characters\n\u20b95.00\n\u20b95.00\n\u20b94.50\n\u20b94.00\nDocument AI\nSERVICE\nPAY AS YOU GO\nPRO\nGROWTH\nBUSINESS\nParse API\nper page\n\u20b90.50\n\u20b90.50\n\u20b90.50\n\u20b90.50\nExtraction API\nper page\n\u20b91.00\n\u20b91.00\n\u20b91.00\n\u20b90.80\nDubbing\nSERVICE\nPAY AS YOU GO\nPRO\nGROWTH\nBUSINESS\nDubbing API\nAudio and video dubbing\nper minute\n\u20b940.00\n\u20b936.00\n\u20b930.00\n\u20b924.00\nYour questions, answered\n\nEverything you need to know about pricing and credits.\n\nWhat is the pricing for Text to Speech (Bulbul v3)?\nText to Speech is priced at \u20b93.00 per 1,000 characters for both real-time and streaming usage.\nWhat should I pay when I get started?\nYou'll receive \u20b9100 worth of free credits on signup. Once these credits are used, you can add more credits whenever you need them.\nHow many credits do I receive?\nWhen you make a payment, you receive the same number of credits as the amount paid. For example, \u20b91,000 gives you 1,000 credits, available immediately in your account.\nDo I need to pay again next month?\nPay as you go has no monthly fee: you only pay when you buy more credits. Pro, Growth, and Business have a minimum monthly subscription that comes back in full as credits. You renew that subscription to keep the plan rate and limits, and you can add more credits any time.\nWhat happens if I don't use all my credits? Do they expire?\nNo, credits do not expire. Any unused credits are rolled over automatically and remain available until you use them.\nOnce I use up all my credits, what happens?\nOnce your credits are exhausted, API calls will return errors. You'll be notified and can add more credits at any time. Top-ups do not change your plan benefits, including rate limits.\nCan I increase my rate limit?\nYes, this is possible under a custom arrangement. We can discuss and configure higher limits based on your specific use case.\nDo my credits cover all APIs and features?\nYes, credits are universal and can be used across all supported APIs and services.\nHow do I purchase more credits?\nYou can top up from the dashboard whenever you need. Your existing account limits remain the same.\nCan I get an invoice for my payment?\nYes. An official invoice will be automatically generated and shared after every payment.\nDo you support refunds or cancellations?\nNo, since credits do not expire and roll over indefinitely for now, all payments are final and non-refundable.\nHow are credits calculated for usage?\nCredits are deducted according to the API used. Text to Speech is billed by characters, Speech to Text by audio duration, LLMs by tokens, Document AI by pages, and Dubbing by the minute.\nCan multiple team members share the same credits?\nCurrently, credits are tied to a single account. We are working on introducing organization-level accounts, which will allow multiple team members to manage usage and credits seamlessly under one shared account.\nIs there a minimum or maximum purchase amount for credits?\nThere is a minimum purchase amount. For larger or custom requirements, our team can configure higher packages.\nWhat happens if I need features or limits outside the standard plan?\nWe offer custom plans for advanced use cases, such as higher rate limits, enterprise billing, or additional support. These can be tailored to your needs.\n\nStart building\n\nwith free credits\n\nGet started\n\nAI for all from India\n\nFind us at\n\n\u00a9 2026 Axonwise Private Limited. All rights reserved.\n\n732, Chinmaya Mission Hospital Road, Indiranagar Stage 1, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560038\n\nPRODUCTS\nContent Studio\nToken Factory\nDocument AI\nWork Agents\nCoding Agents\nSarvam Edge\nModel Training\nAPIS\nText to Speech\nSpeech to Text\nDoc Digitisation\nTranslation\nModels\nRESOURCES\nBlogs\nBuilding AI Agents\nEvents\nCustomer Stories\nDocumentation\nAPI Pricing\nIntegrations\nStartup Program\nSarvam Champions\nCOMPANY\nAbout Us\nCareers\nContact Us\nBrand\nBrand Guidelines\nPartnerships\nLEGAL\nTrust Center\nTerms of Service\nPrivacy Policy\nEULA\nWe value your privacy\n\nWe use cookies to operate the site securely, measure performance, and deliver relevant content. Learn more in our Privacy Policy.\n\nManage\nAccept all",
